      "side": 1,
      "message": "* When a new user or profile is added ?\n* When the VPN adds or removes routes ?\n  (This can happen in seamless handover and your code depends on whether there is a default route. Realistically it\u0027s very unlikely this can happen without dis/re-connection because a change in INTERNET capability disqualifies the VPN from seamless handover, and changing whether a default route is present will concretely change that in all practical cases, but strictly speaking it is possible by just adding large coverage with no default routes. Concretely you need to do this when the VPN updates its LinkProperties if the updates changes whether there is a defaut route).",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 22,
        "startChar": 0,
