      "message": "* When a new user or profile is added\nThere is a recent change aosp/906754 that triggers a NetworkCapabilities update when restricted profile of an active VPN is added/removed. That will result in a CS.setUids() invocation which will in turn call PermissionMonitor.onVpnUidRangesAdded/Removed() so I think we are covered there. If the hosting user of the VPN is deleted, that should trigger the normal VPN disconnection flow so we are also covered on that front.\n\n* When the VPN adds or removes routes\nGood point, fixed in CS.",
