        "filename": "services/core/java/com/android/server/connectivity/PermissionMonitor.java",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 89,
      "author": {
        "id": 1059499
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-02-28T00:18:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "1. PackageManager.getInstalledPackages() is an expensive operation so I feel doing the incremental maintenance is better performance-wise.\n2. We need to expand the list to individual uids which the eBPF program accepts. The VPN uid range is often 0-99999 to cover the entire uid possibilities for a single android user (http://cs/android/frameworks/base/core/java/android/net/UidRange.java?l\u003d39\u0026rcl\u003d4fecb6af1a432d1c17cc18751d9d67221f3db965), expanding that naively to uids without intersecting it with the list of installed apps will result in a very large list.",
      "parentUuid": "790a8aa3_efc4521e",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 89,
        "startChar": 31,
        "endLine": 89,
        "endChar": 39
      },
      "revId": "40d6cc4d4163f8c5dbfd6066424aad169246b816",
